'''Geodude''' (Japanese: '''イシツブテ''' ''Isitsubute'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

