==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Geodude|105}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Geodude}}.
*{{m|Tackle}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Geodude}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

